{"benchmark": "livebench_selected", "task_id": "paraphrase:f4cbfc58a683894a66b028420969bb75a35fe4acda1bd3dce0024062c11b2041", "sample_idx": 27, "model_name": "meta/llama-3.3-70b-instruct", "content": "\"To access the print version of the article, a link is provided. The rules for the Sudoku puzzle are explained, with a key exception: cells within grey lines must add up to the numbers in the corner. This variation on the classic game adds a new level of complexity and challenge for solvers. The usual rule of not repeating numbers within each shape still applies, requiring careful thought and attention to detail. The puzzle is a fun and engaging way to exercise the mind.\"\n\n\n \n\nAddition to the standard Sudoku rules is made with the grey lines, which require the numbers inside to sum up to the given figures. The corner figures serve as a guide, helping solvers to figure out the correct combinations of numbers. As the numbers are filled in, the puzzle becomes increasingly complex, requiring solvers to think logically and make deductions. With each new number added, the possibilities for the remaining cells change, making it a dynamic and engaging challenge. The unique twist on the classic game makes it a must-try for puzzle enthusiasts.\n\n\n \n\nThe instructions for the puzzle are clear and concise, making it easy for new solvers to jump in and start playing. The exception to the standard rules is straightforward, and the example of the grey lines and corner figures helps to illustrate the concept. As solvers work through the puzzle, they will need to balance the standard Sudoku rules with the new twist, using their problem-solving skills to overcome obstacles. With patience and persistence, anyone can master the puzzle and enjoy the sense of accomplishment that comes with it.\n\n\n \n\nFor those who get stuck or want to check their work, the completed puzzle will be available in next week's Observer Digital Edition. This provides a convenient way to verify solutions or learn from mistakes, helping solvers to improve their skills and tackle even more challenging puzzles in the future. The availability of the completed puzzle also adds an extra layer of fun, as solvers can compare their own work to the official solution and see how they did. Whether you're a seasoned puzzle solver or just starting out, the Sudoku challenge is a great way to exercise your mind and have fun.\n\n\n \n\nThe Sudoku puzzle is a great way to relax and unwind, providing a healthy distraction from the stresses of everyday life. As solvers focus on the numbers and patterns, they can let go of their worries and immerse themselves in the challenge. With its unique blend of logic and problem-solving, the puzzle is an engaging and rewarding activity that can be enjoyed by people of all ages and skill levels. Whether you're looking to improve your cognitive skills or simply have fun, the Sudoku puzzle is a great choice, and the addition of the grey lines and corner figures makes it an even more exciting and dynamic challenge.", "logprobs": [{"token": "\"To", "logprob": -0.4018803536891937}, {"token": " access", "logprob": -0.04305700585246086}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.0232519693672657}, {"token": " print", "logprob": -0.008725020103156567}, {"token": " version", "logprob": -7.486063259420916e-05}, {"token": " of", "logprob": -0.0031777145341038704}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.011118361726403236}, {"token": " article", "logprob": -0.2270030528306961}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.002512990264222026}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.024781323969364166}, {"token": " link", "logprob": -0.008299149572849274}, {"token": " is", "logprob": -0.0067192567512393}, {"token": " provided", "logprob": -0.00012361239350866526}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -0.31154054403305054}, {"token": " The", "logprob": -0.0039595551788806915}, {"token": " rules", "logprob": -0.11019902676343918}, {"token": " for", "logprob": -0.02659463882446289}, {"token": " the", "logprob": 